// E603 — province already claimed.
//
// The mistake here is picking two different counties without noticing
// they're the same province. Corcaigh and Ciarraí are both in An Mhumhain;
// one struct per province, so `Duine` in Corcaigh closes the rest of
// Munster too. Four placed types per program, total.

struchtúr Duine as Corcaigh {
    ainm: Teaghrán
}

struchtúr Áit as Ciarraí {
    ainm: Teaghrán
}